{"schemaVersion":1,"id":-40554,"sections":[{"id":"script-20554","name":"原始脚本 20554","scripts":[20554],"start":0,"count":113}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:1","scriptId":20554,"text":"黄昏时分，死水任务大厅里并没有多少人，感觉还有点冷清。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-129.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:2","scriptId":20554,"text":"“等会儿就要出发了啊，佐伊她们怎么还没来？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-129.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1116,"speaker":"玛加丽塔·杰米多娃","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:3","scriptId":20554,"text":"“可能是行李比较多？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-129.webp","left":4,"right":1116,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:4","scriptId":20554,"text":"“呃……大概吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-129.webp","left":4,"right":1116,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1116,"speaker":"玛加丽塔·杰米多娃","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:5","scriptId":20554,"text":"“没关系，反正我们有专用的运输机，只要不是太晚都没什么关系。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-129.webp","left":4,"right":1116,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:6","scriptId":20554,"text":"站在我身边的这位姑娘是玛加丽塔·杰米多娃，来自特别空勤队，该部队隶属于S.V.S胜利女神特勤局。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-129.webp","left":4,"right":1116,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:7","scriptId":20554,"text":"一直以来陆战钢舞姬是主要的对战车兽作战单位，但由于飞行战车兽的出现与之对应的航空钢舞姬也孕育而生。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-129.webp","left":4,"right":1116,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:8","scriptId":20554,"text":"飞行战车兽有很大一部分还是陆战时候的样子，只是被赋予了飞行能力，这种突然进化的原因众说纷纭。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-129.webp","left":4,"right":1116,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:9","scriptId":20554,"text":"不过就波西娅这里的情报，航空钢舞姬的研发其实进行了很长一段时间，只不过最近才终于站上了世界的舞台。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-129.webp","left":4,"right":1116,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:10","scriptId":20554,"text":"“希望亚当斯长官不要生气。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-129.webp","left":4,"right":1116,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1116,"speaker":"玛加丽塔·杰米多娃","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:11","scriptId":20554,"text":"“不会不会，他虽然有点怪，但不会胡乱发脾气的。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-129.webp","left":4,"right":1116,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:12","scriptId":20554,"text":"“诶？有点怪？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-129.webp","left":4,"right":1116,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:13","scriptId":20554,"text":"由于跟泰莱塔一战，旅行者这种天外来客曝光以后轰动全球，同时也让死水佣兵成为了世界的焦点。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-129.webp","left":4,"right":1116,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:14","scriptId":20554,"text":"这次我作为死水的特派指挥临时加入特别空勤队也是拜这场战役所赐。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-129.webp","left":4,"right":1116,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1116,"speaker":"玛加丽塔·杰米多娃","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:15","scriptId":20554,"text":"“见到他就你知道了～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-129.webp","left":4,"right":1116,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:16","scriptId":20554,"text":"“恩，不过让我这个陆军指挥去空勤队……总觉得哪里不太对。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-129.webp","left":4,"right":1116,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1116,"speaker":"玛加丽塔·杰米多娃","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:17","scriptId":20554,"text":"“哈哈～我也挺想知道为什么呢～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-129.webp","left":4,"right":1116,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:18","scriptId":20554,"text":"玛加丽塔扭头看向我，仔细地端详了一番。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-129.webp","left":4,"right":1116,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:19","scriptId":20554,"text":"“看我也没用，我的脸上可没有答案。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-129.webp","left":4,"right":1116,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1116,"speaker":"玛加丽塔·杰米多娃","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:20","scriptId":20554,"text":"“但这都是领导层面的事情，我们这些执行的人也管不了那么多。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-129.webp","left":4,"right":1116,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1116,"speaker":"玛加丽塔·杰米多娃","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:21","scriptId":20554,"text":"“长官是名人，我觉得是想扩大空钢的影响力吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-129.webp","left":4,"right":1116,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":747,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:22","scriptId":20554,"text":"“长官，你怎么在这里啊，让我们好找。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-129.webp","left":747,"right":1116,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:23","scriptId":20554,"text":"有个钢舞姬急急忙忙地跑了过来。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-129.webp","left":747,"right":1116,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:24","scriptId":20554,"text":"“恩？佐伊？来得有点晚啊，其他人呢？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-129.webp","left":747,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":749,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:25","scriptId":20554,"text":"“说什么胡话呢！不是在老地方集合吗？看你迟迟不来，我才出来找你的。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-129.webp","left":749,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:26","scriptId":20554,"text":"“诶？是这样的吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-129.webp","left":749,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1116,"speaker":"玛加丽塔·杰米多娃","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:27","scriptId":20554,"text":"“看样子是在传达的时候出了点小差错？不要紧，我们这就过去。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-129.webp","left":1116,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":747,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:28","scriptId":20554,"text":"“这位是？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-129.webp","left":1116,"right":747,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1116,"speaker":"玛加丽塔·杰米多娃","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:29","scriptId":20554,"text":"“你好，我是玛加丽塔，是来接你们小队的，估计今后也会和你们一起共事～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-129.webp","left":1116,"right":747,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:30","scriptId":20554,"text":"“哦！刚刚跑过来的时候就注意到了，空钢的舞装很特别，一眼就看出来了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-129.webp","left":1116,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:32","scriptId":20554,"text":"今天的安排都和自己小队的成员交待过，所以佐伊见到玛加丽塔也没特别的惊讶。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-129.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:33","scriptId":20554,"text":"由于搞混了集合地点，所以延误了一些时间，不过我们还是在傍晚时分坐上了飞往特别空勤队总部的运输机。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-129.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:34","scriptId":20554,"text":"没想到会在飞行途中遇到战车兽。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-129.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:36","scriptId":20554,"text":"不过这样一来，我们也亲眼见识到了航空钢舞姬的战斗。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:37","scriptId":20554,"text":"击退了飞行战车兽后，我们继续航行，后面一路顺畅，很快就到达了目的地。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:38","scriptId":20554,"text":"“现在头还有点晕乎乎的……好难过……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":740,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":572,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:39","scriptId":20554,"text":"“这位乘客要不要来点晕机药～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":740,"right":572,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:40","scriptId":20554,"text":"“晚了啦！呕……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":740,"right":572,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":916,"speaker":"梅丽雅·马尔斯","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:41","scriptId":20554,"text":"“这点程度的颠簸根本算不上什么啦，看我啥事都没有～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":740,"right":916,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":596,"speaker":"维卡","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:42","scriptId":20554,"text":"“还是地上踏实。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":596,"right":916,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":940,"speaker":"伊诺·赞佩里尼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:43","scriptId":20554,"text":"“是的，在机舱里完全没有自由。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":596,"right":940,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:44","scriptId":20554,"text":"“飞行途中遇到战车兽什么的还是第一次呢。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":584,"right":940,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":928,"speaker":"莉迪亚·鲍里索夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:45","scriptId":20554,"text":"“刚才炮管好像撞到了机舱上……”（小声）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":584,"right":928,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":897,"speaker":"芙琳·勒布","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:46","scriptId":20554,"text":"“注意注意，已经达到目的地，稍作休息之后就整队吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":897,"right":928,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:47","scriptId":20554,"text":"最末尾的芙琳在确认完机舱内部的情况后走出了机舱。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":897,"right":928,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:48","scriptId":20554,"text":"这次的任务虽然没有强制指令，但除了暂时离队的尤拉之外，其他人都一并跟来了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":897,"right":928,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1116,"speaker":"玛加丽塔·杰米多娃","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:50","scriptId":20554,"text":"“长官的队伍还真热闹。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1116,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:51","scriptId":20554,"text":"“管教不周，见笑了。看你刚才对付飞行战车兽的手法，好像已经非常熟练了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1116,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1116,"speaker":"玛加丽塔·杰米多娃","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:52","scriptId":20554,"text":"“是的，已经干掉过许多了，特别是投弹型的战车兽，如果不及时处理后果不堪设想。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1116,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:53","scriptId":20554,"text":"“那工作量可真不小。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1116,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1116,"speaker":"玛加丽塔·杰米多娃","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:54","scriptId":20554,"text":"“还好吧，飞行战车兽的数量不多，大部分的装甲还是陆地时的样子，说白了只是会飞而已，命中精度太差。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1116,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1116,"speaker":"玛加丽塔·杰米多娃","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:55","scriptId":20554,"text":"“况且作战经验上的差距也很大，胡乱飞是根本不构成威胁呃～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1116,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:56","scriptId":20554,"text":"“难怪你刚才一个人就解决了空中的好几个战车兽。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1116,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1116,"speaker":"玛加丽塔·杰米多娃","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:57","scriptId":20554,"text":"“和打鸭子差不多啦～嘿嘿嘿～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1116,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:58","scriptId":20554,"text":"于是玛加丽塔带领我们离开停机平台开始往空勤队基地方向移动。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1116,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:60","scriptId":20554,"text":"穿过一片和废墟差不多的过道之后，我们来到了一栋残破的大楼前。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1116,"speaker":"玛加丽塔·杰米多娃","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:61","scriptId":20554,"text":"“到了～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1116,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:62","scriptId":20554,"text":"“这里是……？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1116,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:63","scriptId":20554,"text":"大门口残破的雕像，大楼本身有多处损坏的痕迹，很难想象这里会是特别空勤队的基地。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1116,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:64","scriptId":20554,"text":"以一般常识来说，在这种“废墟”中办公简直是不可想象的事情，况且这里好像还不是办公场所……","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1116,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":596,"speaker":"维卡","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:65","scriptId":20554,"text":"“这里是战地医院？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1116,"right":596,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:66","scriptId":20554,"text":"毕竟是Ｓ国的境内，维卡好像对这里有点印象的样子。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1116,"right":596,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:67","scriptId":20554,"text":"“医院？那让我们来这里是……？难道还要先体检吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":740,"right":596,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":897,"speaker":"芙琳·勒布","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:68","scriptId":20554,"text":"“从这里的荒废程度来看，真的可以体检吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":740,"right":897,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:69","scriptId":20554,"text":"当佐伊她们开始就眼前的废墟展开讨论的时候，玛加丽塔发话了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":740,"right":897,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1116,"speaker":"玛加丽塔·杰米多娃","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:70","scriptId":20554,"text":"“各位，亚当斯长官来了，接下来就由他来给各位进行详细说明吧～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1116,"right":897,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:71","scriptId":20554,"text":"随着玛加丽塔扬手的位置望去，一位身着蓝色制服的人出现在了我们的视线里。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1116,"right":897,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1111,"speaker":"亚当斯·哈柏林","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:72","scriptId":20554,"text":"“来自死水的诸君，辛苦了。我是亚当斯·哈柏林，这里的总指挥兼负责人。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":897,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:73","scriptId":20554,"text":"对方是此处的长官，那这边也不能失了礼节。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":897,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:74","scriptId":20554,"text":"“你好，我是——","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1111,"speaker":"亚当斯·哈柏林","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:75","scriptId":20554,"text":"“啊哈，你就是死水的特派指挥，我见过你，很高兴和你见面。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1111,"speaker":"亚当斯·哈柏林","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:76","scriptId":20554,"text":"“对了，和泰莱塔一役的部分细节等会儿我还想向你讨教一下。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:77","scriptId":20554,"text":"突然被打断了自我介绍让人觉得有些不悦，但是对方貌似对自己非常了解的样子，这不由得让人心里发毛。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:78","scriptId":20554,"text":"这时亚当斯继续说道。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1111,"speaker":"亚当斯·哈柏林","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:79","scriptId":20554,"text":"“我记得你们的队名是华尔兹小队吧，这小队的名字非常悦耳呢，起名的人一定很有品位。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1111,"speaker":"亚当斯·哈柏林","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:80","scriptId":20554,"text":"“各位女士们也都非常美丽动人，完全看不出是身经百战的钢舞姬，保养得很好嘛～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:81","scriptId":20554,"text":"虽然被人夸赞是很高兴，但我知道这都是台面话，不过后面的那群姑娘们或许就不这么认为了……","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:82","scriptId":20554,"text":"能明显地感觉到后面队伍中的躁动。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:83","scriptId":20554,"text":"“哪里哪里，亚当斯长官过奖了，对了，这里就是特别空勤队的基地了吗？有些——","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1111,"speaker":"亚当斯·哈柏林","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:84","scriptId":20554,"text":"“是的，我能感觉到你的顾虑。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:85","scriptId":20554,"text":"亚当斯又是没等我话说完。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1111,"speaker":"亚当斯·哈柏林","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:86","scriptId":20554,"text":"“这里原本是战地医院，并且已经被战车兽破坏，失去了大部分的功能，不过……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:87","scriptId":20554,"text":"“不过？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1111,"speaker":"亚当斯·哈柏林","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:88","scriptId":20554,"text":"“这是一种伪装，我们特意把基地建在这废墟之中，就是为了防止基地被发觉。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:89","scriptId":20554,"text":"“哦，是利用原本的废墟当做伪装，不过为什么要这么做呢？以特勤局的实力，在这里设防也没什问题。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1111,"speaker":"亚当斯·哈柏林","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:90","scriptId":20554,"text":"“啧啧啧，毕竟你对我们这里的情况还不是很了解，我来给你说明一下吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:91","scriptId":20554,"text":"亚当斯的语气有些得意，不过这也在情理之中，毕竟这里他的地盘。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1111,"speaker":"亚当斯·哈柏林","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:92","scriptId":20554,"text":"“首先这里原本是一家很大规模的战地医院，设有专用的航空指挥塔和停机坪，方便运送急救人员。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:93","scriptId":20554,"text":"“哦，就是说这里的设施对空勤队本身具有利用价值。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:94","scriptId":20554,"text":"我的突然插嘴让亚当斯停了一下，不过他并不在意的样子。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1111,"speaker":"亚当斯·哈柏林","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:95","scriptId":20554,"text":"“是的，航空指挥塔和停机坪经过维修之后能很快恢复使用，不需要花大力气从零开始建设。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1111,"speaker":"亚当斯·哈柏林","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:96","scriptId":20554,"text":"“飞行跑道也是如此，一般的基地可不具备这种规模的设施。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:97","scriptId":20554,"text":"“但这样重新建设一下更好吧？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:98","scriptId":20554,"text":"听到我的疑问，亚当斯摇了摇头。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1111,"speaker":"亚当斯·哈柏林","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:99","scriptId":20554,"text":"“很可惜，特别空勤队目前并不受特勤局总部的重视，军备资金可没那么充足，光是控制室的改建就花了不少钱。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:100","scriptId":20554,"text":"“呃，这样的吗……财政方面的问题我就不好插嘴了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1111,"speaker":"亚当斯·哈柏林","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:101","scriptId":20554,"text":"“财政只是一方面，另一方面，我们确实不需要重建，因为就如开始所说，这伪装是非常必要的。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:102","scriptId":20554,"text":"“？？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:103","scriptId":20554,"text":"看到我有些似懂非懂，亚当斯继续解说道。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1111,"speaker":"亚当斯·哈柏林","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:104","scriptId":20554,"text":"“因为要应对空袭。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:105","scriptId":20554,"text":"经亚当斯这么一说，我立刻明白过来。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:106","scriptId":20554,"text":"“对啊，我怎么忘了，最近的空袭问题越来越严重，如果要把这里建设成空勤基地，还需要大量的防空设备。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1111,"speaker":"亚当斯·哈柏林","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:107","scriptId":20554,"text":"“大量的防空设备姑且不提，能避免被选为飞行战车兽的攻击目标就行。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1111,"speaker":"亚当斯·哈柏林","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:108","scriptId":20554,"text":"“航空钢舞姬的规模不是特别大，所以也不会有很多守军，经不起长期的消耗战。时不时来一次空袭什么的我们可吃不消。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:109","scriptId":20554,"text":"话说到这里，亚当斯顿了顿，就好像在等我的话一样。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:110","scriptId":20554,"text":"“那我们接下来要干什么呢？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1111,"speaker":"亚当斯·哈柏林","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:111","scriptId":20554,"text":"“接下来我会把航空钢舞姬也编入你的队伍。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:112","scriptId":20554,"text":"“哦？航空钢舞姬的指挥权吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1111,"speaker":"亚当斯·哈柏林","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:113","scriptId":20554,"text":"“是的，光是陆地的指挥还不够，你要同时负责指挥空中和陆地，掌握整个立体化的战场。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:114","scriptId":20554,"text":"“诶？有点突然啊……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1111,"speaker":"亚当斯·哈柏林","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:115","scriptId":20554,"text":"“这是你们维多利亚团长的意思。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:116","scriptId":20554,"text":"“呃，原来是团长啊……好吧，我知道了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1111,"speaker":"亚当斯·哈柏林","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20554:20554:117","scriptId":20554,"text":"“那就这样，先分派给你始祖鸟小队吧，花几天时间熟悉一下空钢的战斗原理。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
